flowchart LR
    Req([Admin UI request]) --> WP[WP App Password / cookie auth]
    WP --> Map[Map WP user -> plugin Profile]
    Map --> Roles[Load RoleAssignment for Profile]
    Roles --> Perms[Resolve RolePermission union]
    Perms --> Check{Required Permission<br/>in resolved set?}
    Check -- Yes --> Allow([Handler executes])
    Check -- No  --> Deny([Reject GL-AUTHZ-PERMISSION-DENIED])
    Allow --> Audit1[AuditTrail Success]
    Deny  --> Audit2[AuditTrail Rejected]

    subgraph SeededRules
      AdminRow[Role=Admin -> all Permissions seeded]
      EditorRow[Role=Editor -> AppView, AppModify,<br/>HistoryView, RepoView]
    end
